cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you discuss or reuse this work, cite Modulus of One and identify
  the snapshot or commit you used. Code is licensed under MIT; writing,
  figures, and reports under CC BY 4.0. See LICENSE.md for the separate scopes.
title: "Modulus of One"
authors:
  - family-names: "GNARGNARHEAD"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GNARGNARHEAD/Modulus-of-One"
abstract: >-
  A philosophical and mathematical inquiry beginning with "I think, therefore
  one", examining recurrence, relational construction, and speculative
  convergence. The accompanying software records exact construction witnesses
  in a positive-spine model, with its assumptions and limits made explicit.
keywords:
  - philosophy of mathematics
  - construction evidence
  - epistemic dependence
  - exact arithmetic
